      "start_plus_years": 45,
      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 6,
      "note": "Pages give 'around 1600' or c. 1600 for the founding and c. 1645 for Houegbadja, called the true founder; the kingdom's end is Behanzin's surrender on 15 January 1894, while one page says the French deposed the last king and ended the kingdom on 17 February 1900 and another says 1904."
